      "original_question": "The goal-to-obligation direction and necessary-component interpretation of depends_all are supported by the documented Apply sequence. However, the actual leader notification consumer and processLogs implementation are absent. The available FSM code consumes commit tuples without establishing how their command identities and indexes were selected. The implementing handoff required by this review therefore remains unresolved; the relation should remain unconfirmed.",
