      "original_question": "The goal-to-obligation direction and depends_all interpretation remain supported. New material establishes that leaderLoop consumes commitCh, reads commitment.getCommitIndex and updates the Raft commit index. It also supplies processLogs, which traverses lastApplied+1 through its supplied limit, chooses future-backed or stored logs, prepares command tuples and sends batches to fsmMutateCh. However, the leaderLoop excerpt stops at line 800 before the inflight-selection and processLogs handoff. The runFSM receive loop is also outside the supplied FSM range. The prior issue is therefore narrowed but unresolved.",
