        "raft.go:450:800",
        "raft.go:801:880",
        "raft.go:1180:1439",
        "fsm.go:1:180",
        "fsm.go:181:285"
      ],
      "rationale": "Both specifically missing continuations are now supplied. The leader consumer stops selecting inflight logs when their index exceeds commitIndex, passes an index-keyed future map and the last selected index to processLogs, then removes the selected inflight entries. The FSM receive loop passes commit-tuple batches to the previously supplied application closures. Shutdown can interrupt delivery, and restoration is a distinct mutation branch; neither is evidence that an ordinary command bypasses the committed selection limit. The reading issue is resolved without asserting liveness, runtime reproduction or completeness of the goal's obligations.",
