  "resolution_rationale": "The newly supplied leaderLoop continuation and runFSM receive loop, together with the supplied processLogs implementation, answer both stored missing-handoff questions. These resolutions concern source availability and the necessary-component interpretation of R_apply_commit. They neither mutate version-1 graph fields nor discharge the remaining producer and delivery guarantees.",
