        "raft.go:1180:1439"
      ],
      "explanation": "The accumulator's comments explicitly assign it monotonically increasing quorum commitment and a first-entry-of-term prerequisite. setupLeaderState creates a fresh instance using the latest configuration and getLastIndex()+1; runLeader dispatches an initial no-op. These actual callers support the bounded responsibility. The obligation concerns reported support and does not assume that the reports themselves are true.",
      "alternatives": "A previously committed index may remain unchanged after voter-set replacement without obtaining fresh support from the replacement set. The current advancement-only wording preserves this distinction.",
      "counterexample_reasoning": "A caller could provide false reports or an inadmissible membership history while every local advancement satisfies O_commit. That would challenge the boundary guarantees, not invalidate this local responsibility.",
      "limitations": [
        "The complete configuration-change admission path has not been supplied.",
        "Report provenance across peer changes and storage durability remain unresolved."
      ]
    },
    {
