      "explanation": "The consumer-to-producer direction and boundary kind accurately preserve the missing guarantee. match requires stored-prefix agreement; replicateTo hands a successful request to updateLastAppended; follower appendEntries validates and stores entries before success on the visible path. The missing helper and storage contract prevent promotion to established support. The newly visible local-write producer is separate from this explicitly remote relation.",
      "alternatives": "Local StoreLogs completion, pipelined responses and installed snapshots are distinct progress producers requiring separately sourced treatment.",
      "counterexample_reasoning": "Follower suffix deletion followed by failed append leaves a source-noted metadata concern. Without the storage and subsequent request/report semantics, neither safe evidence production nor a real violation follows. The accumulator may still satisfy O_commit with unsound inputs.",
